follow svg {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .sea-collab {\n      padding: 20px;\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n    .sea-collab__follow {\n      width: 100%;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .sea-collab__name {\n      font-size: 19px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Disclosure: the \"Affiliate\" badge carries the 4.H material connection (16 CFR Part 255).\n  Geronimo has an active affiliate discount code with Seatopia. Change the badge to\n  \"Paid partner\" if this recipe was also a paid commission.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<div class=\"sea-collab\">\n  <div class=\"sea-collab__avatar\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/317954084_536934878448812_7477395931531424226_n.jpg?width=200\" alt=\"Geronimo Ramos\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sea-collab__body\">\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__eyebrow\">\n      <span>Guest recipe</span>\n      <span class=\"sea-collab__badge\">Affiliate</span>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__name\">Recipe by &#64;geronimocramos</p>\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__role\">Pop-up chef Geronimo Ramos, cooking with <a href=\"/products/smoke-in-chimneys-smoked-trout-filet\" title=\"Seatopia Smoked Trout Filets\">our Smoked Trout Filets</a></p>\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__cred\">Makes 2 tostadas &middot; 15 minutes &middot; nothing to cook</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <a class=\"sea-collab__follow\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/geronimocramos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\"></rect>\n      <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"></circle>\n    </svg>\n    <span>F