        "text_intro": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If smoked trout only ever lands on your bagel, this is its best move. Geronimo builds a crisp tostada on a thick layer of avocado-lime crema, piles on big flakes of our hot-smoked trout, and finishes it with a fresh cucumber salsa, pickled red onion, pomegranate and a glossy drizzle of salsa macha.</p><p>Nothing gets cooked. Thaw the trout the night before, blend the crema, chop the salsa and build. It is on the plate in about 15 minutes &mdash; dinner for one, or a light bite for two. Feeding four? Use two packages of trout and double everything.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
